      "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/@13.6514709,123.2321180,80m/data=!3m1!1e3",
      "note": "Inspected owner-supplied pacol-elementary-school.png on 2026-10-08; capture date unknown. URL locates the site. North and south perimeter belts, western interior grove, distinguishable small plants along the north classroom apron and eastern Educare-side strip. The large central tan yard remains bare. Corrected east Educare roof registration; entrance links follow exposed edges, not a paved whole-yard fill. Image roof sections matched separately to complete source roof corners; excluded opposite corners on distinct roofs provide independent checks. Mapped older roof sizes differ from imagery; sections are used independently rather than smoothing incompatible dimensions across the yard. Checks establish local roof-section accuracy, not a surveyed campus-wide transformation. Visible greenery is authored relative to its nearest matched section. Independent excluded check errors: 0.36 m, 0.15 m, 0.22 m. Visible crown centers are fitted to clear trunks within the observed crown footprint (maximum seven metres); crowns may overhang roofs and roads. Crown widths in the dense belts are estimated from image pixels against their matched local roof scale; existing circular crowns approximate irregular/elliptical image crowns. Complete mapped roofs, pitches, full-width paths/roads, water and farmland remain unchanged. Planted islands take precedence over exposed paving; ground under opaque canopy is not invented. No surveyed boundary, species, construction date or exact inventory inferred; no bitmap ships."
